# Legend Pure — Repository Summary

## Overview

**Legend Pure** is the underlying programming language for the [Legend](https://github.com/finos/legend) platform, an open-source data management and governance platform originally developed by **Goldman Sachs** and contributed to **FINOS** (Fintech Open Source Foundation). It is licensed under **Apache 2.0**.

- **Version**: `5.56.1-SNAPSHOT`
- **Build**: Maven 3.6+ multi-module project, targeting **Java 8** bytecode (requires **JDK 11 or 17** to compile)
- **Codebase size**: ~2,088 Java source files + ~274 Pure language source files (excluding build artifacts)

---

## What Is "Pure"?

Pure is a **functional, statically-typed, platform-independent modeling language**. It is designed for defining data models, transformations, and queries in a technology-agnostic way. The language has its own type system with generics, multiplicity, constraints, and a rich metamodel defined in a self-bootstrapping style (the language defines its own metamodel in `.pure` files).

---

## Module Architecture

The repo uses a layered architecture with these top-level Maven modules:

```mermaid
graph TD
    A["legend-pure-core"] --> B["legend-pure-dsl"]
    A --> C["legend-pure-functions"]
    A --> D["legend-pure-runtime"]
    A --> E["legend-pure-store"]
    A --> F["legend-pure-maven"]
```

### 1. `legend-pure-core` — Language Foundation

The foundational layer, containing the metamodel and parser infrastructure.

| Sub-module | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `legend-pure-m4` | **Base graph layer** – lowest level model/graph primitives (nodes, properties, sources). Uses ANTLR for grammar definitions. |
| `legend-pure-m3-core` | **Core language** – parser, compiler, type checker, the full M3 metamodel (3,593-line `m3.pure` bootstrap file defining `Class`, `Type`, `GenericType`, `Property`, `Package`, etc.), navigation, incremental compilation, code storage, and the platform function library. |
| `legend-pure-m3-bootstrap-generator` | Generates bootstrap Java code from the Pure metamodel definitions. |
| `legend-pure-m3-precisePrimitives` | Extended precise numeric primitive types (e.g., `Decimal`). |

### 2. `legend-pure-dsl` — Domain-Specific Languages

Extensions to the core language for specific modeling concerns:

| Sub-module | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `legend-pure-dsl-diagram` | Visual diagram DSL (for model diagrams) |
| `legend-pure-dsl-graph` | Graph fetch / tree DSL |
| `legend-pure-dsl-mapping` | Model-to-model mapping DSL |
| `legend-pure-dsl-path` | Path expression DSL |
| `legend-pure-dsl-store` | Abstract store DSL |
| `legend-pure-dsl-tds` | Tabular Data Set (TDS) DSL |

Each DSL sub-module typically contains a `-pure` sub-module (Pure source definitions) and a `-grammar` sub-module (ANTLR parser/grammar).

### 3. `legend-pure-functions` — Standard Library

Pure's built-in function library:

| Sub-module | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `legend-pure-functions-base` | Core functions (collection, string, math, date, boolean, meta, IO, etc.) |
| `legend-pure-functions-json` | JSON serialization/deserialization functions |
| `legend-pure-functions-relation` | Relational algebra functions (filter, join, project, group, window, etc.) |

### 4. `legend-pure-runtime` — Execution Engines

Two Java-based execution engines for running Pure code:

| Sub-module | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `legend-pure-runtime-java-engine-compiled` | **Compiled engine** — transpiles Pure to Java bytecode for high performance. Includes compiled extensions for all DSLs and stores (~526 child entries). |
| `legend-pure-runtime-java-engine-interpreted` | **Interpreted engine** — tree-walking interpreter for development/debugging (~318 child entries). |
| `legend-pure-runtime-java-engine-shared` | Shared utilities between both engines. |

### 5. `legend-pure-store` — Store Implementations

| Sub-module | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `legend-pure-store-relational` | Relational database store — SQL generation, database schema modeling, and relational mapping execution. Contains Pure definitions, grammar, and compiled/shared extensions. |

### 6. `legend-pure-maven` — Build Plugins

Custom Maven plugins for the build pipeline:

| Sub-module | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `legend-pure-maven-generation-java` | Maven plugin to generate Java code from Pure sources |
| `legend-pure-maven-generation-par` | Maven plugin to generate PAR (Pure Archive) files |
| `legend-pure-maven-generation-pct` | Maven plugin for PCT (Pure Compatibility Testing) report generation |

